graph TD
    subgraph Phase 1: Import Collection
        A[Export CSV from collection tool] --> B[python -m src.cli.main import-collection<br>--csv collection.csv]
        B --> C{Import successful?}
        C -->|Yes| D[548 entries in user_collection table]
        C -->|No| E[Fix CSV format and retry]
        E --> B
    end

    subgraph Phase 2: Match Report
        D --> F[python -m src.cli.main match-report<br>--limit 10]
        F --> G[Search MYP for each card by name]
        G --> H[Match by SKU exact then name+set then name only]
        H --> I[Print coverage report<br>matched / ambiguous / unmatched]
        I --> J{Coverage acceptable?}
        J -->|Yes| K[Proceed to cleanup]
        J -->|No| L[Review unmatched cards<br>check --output report.json]
        L --> M[Adjust collection or accept gaps]
        M --> K
    end

    subgraph Phase 3: DB Cleanup
        K --> N[python -m src.cli.main db-backup]
        N --> O[Timestamped backup in backups/]
        O --> P[python -m src.cli.main db-cleanup --dry-run]
        P --> Q{Dry-run counts OK?}
        Q -->|Yes| R[python -m src.cli.main db-cleanup]
        Q -->|No| S[Investigate or restore backup]
        R --> T[Non-collection cards removed<br>DB contains only collection scope]
    end

    subgraph Phase 4: Sync Collection
        T --> U[python -m src.cli.main sync-collection<br>--limit 5 --dry-run]
        U --> V{Dry-run OK?}
        V -->|Yes| W[python -m src.cli.main sync-collection]
        V -->|No| X[Debug and fix issues]
        X --> U
        W --> Y[Search + match + fetch + store<br>~35-55 min for 548 cards]
        Y --> Z[Summary: matched / unmatched / errors<br>Price observations stored]
    end

    subgraph Phase 5: Use Dashboard
        Z --> AA[Open Dashboard at localhost:5173]
        AA --> AB[Collection KPIs<br>unique cards, copies, value, coverage]
        AB --> AC[Browse Cards page<br>collection cards with price data]
        AC --> AD[Card Detail<br>Scryfall HD image + price chart]
        AD --> AE[Market Movers<br>top gainers and losers]
    end

